# Links that are fine in a browser but reject automated checkers.
# One regex per line, matched against the full URL.

# Saarland University repository (PhD thesis): returns 403 to bots
^https://publikationen\.sulb\.uni-saarland\.de/

# ACM Digital Library (and DOIs that redirect to it): 403 from CI runners
^https://doi\.org/10\.1145/
^https://dl\.acm\.org/

# X / Twitter: 403 to unauthenticated requests
^https://(www\.)?(x|twitter)\.com/

# Google Scholar: rate-limits CI runners (intermittent 403/429)
^https://scholar\.google\.com/
